{
    "background_story": "In a realm beyond mortal sight, Grey was a guardian angel with wings as white as freshly fallen snow. His wingspan was majestic, with feathers that shimmered like the brightest stars. Grey's role was to watch over the city's lost souls, guiding them through life's turbulent storms. With a gentle touch, he would lift the veil of despair, revealing a glimmer of hope. His wings would whisper words of comfort, soothing the hearts of the broken. One fateful night, a devastating fire swept through the city, leaving many homeless. Grey descended, his wings beating fiercely as he shielded the fleeing crowds from harm. As the flames were extinguished, Grey's wings remained, a symbol of protection and solace, reminding all that they were never truly alone.",
